# Regenerable bulk data, too large for git (~345 MB in total).
#
#   DEM/            clipped elevation rasters, rebuilt from the COP30 tiles
#   OSM/            Overpass extracts (roads, water), refetched on rebuild
#   /*.tif          loose COP30 source tiles copied in from SriPada/DEM;
#                   they are duplicates of that project's downloads
#
# Kept in the repo: _map_build/ (the whole build pipeline, payload and
# template), the vector layers under Boundary/, Streams/, Watersheds/ and
# Peaks, Falls/, cadence-site/, the QGIS project and the published
# Knuckles_3D_Map.html.

DEM/
OSM/
/*.tif

# QGIS scratch
*.qgz~
*.qgd
